<a class="font-bold text-primary hover:underline flex items-center gap-1" href="tel:19006868">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">phone_in_talk</span> Hotline hỗ trợ trực tiếp 24/7: 1900 6868
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
